市人民政府办公室关于印发三明市“十四五”人力资源和社会保障事业发展专项规划的通知"}]}, {"docid2": 1732372, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "规划解读", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zcjd/bszcjd/202111/t20211130_1732372.htm", "content": "\n　　一、背景依据\n　　今年3月，全国人大表决通过的《国民经济和社会发展第十四个五年规划和2035年远景目标纲要》，首次把“统筹发展和安全，建设更高水平的平安中国”单独成篇，并就全面提高公共安全保障能力，维护", "docabstract": "政策解读", "doclogo": "P020211214375230093783.png", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zcjd/bszcjd/202111/t20211130_1732372.htm", "docreltime": "2021.11.30 09:25:00", "doctitle": "图解：《三明市“十四五”消防救援发展事业专项规划》政策解读", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 2, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1858760, "sourcename": "市政府办", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zcjd/bszcjd/202111/t20211130_1732372.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [{"appdesc": "20211214102318.jpg", "appdocid": 1732372, "appfile": "W020211214375049224943.jpg", "appflag": 20, "appsern": 1, "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zcjd/bszcjd/202111/t20211130_1732372.htm", "fileext": "jpg", "_src": "/webpic/W0202112/W020211214/W020211214375049224943.jpg", "_href": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zcjd/bszcjd/202111/W020211214375049224943.jpg"}], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zcjd/bszcjd/202111/", "_firstpic": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zcjd/bszcjd/202111/W020211214375049224943.jpg", "rels": [{"reldocid": 1732314, "docid2": 1732372, "sern": 1, "srcdocpeople": "", "srcdocpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zcjd/bszcjd/202111/t20211130_1732372.htm", "srcdocreltime": "2021-11-30 09:25:00", "srcdoctitle": "图解：《三明市“十四五”消防救援发展事业专项规划》政策解读", "tardocpeople": "", "tardocpuburl": "https://www.sm.gov.cn/smsrmzfbgs/smsrmzf/zfxxgkml/ghjh/202111/t20211130_1732314.htm", "tardocreltime": "2021-11-30 08:11:00", "tardoctitle": "三明市人民政府办公室关于印发三明市“十四五”消防救援事业发展专项规划的通知"}]}, {"docid2": 1729777, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "规划解读", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ghjh/ghjd/202111/t20211123_1729777.htm", "content": "\n　　“十四五”是我国“两个一百年”奋斗目标的历史交汇期，是全面开启社会主义现代化强国建设新征程的重要机遇期，是三明市在新的起点上推进高质量发展的关键时期。\n　　根据三明市人民政府的部署要求，在紧密衔接", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ghjh/ghjd/202111/t20211123_1729777.htm", "docreltime": "2021.11.23 10:41:00", "doctitle": "《三明市“十四五”林业发展专项规划》 政策解读", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1843918, "sourcename": "市林业局", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ghjh/ghjd/202111/t20211123_1729777.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ghjh/ghjd/202111/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1725982, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "规划解读", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zcjd/bszcjd/202111/t20211110_1725982.htm", "content": "\n　　一、背景依据\n　　“十四五”时期是我国开启全面建设社会主义现代化国家新征程、向第二个百年奋斗目标进军、加快建设交通强国的第一个五年，是综合交通运输服务水平提高和转型发展的关键期。习近平总书记作出重", "docabstract": "政策解读", "doclogo": "P020211122403581123535.png", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zcjd/bszcjd/202111/t20211110_1725982.htm", "docreltime": "2021.11.10 17:34:00", "doctitle": "图解：《三明市“十四五”现代综合交通运输体系专项规划》政策解读", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 2, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1846909, "sourcename": "市政府办", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zcjd/bszcjd/202111/t20211110_1725982.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [{"appdesc": "20211122111139.jpg", "appdocid": 1725982, "appfile": "W020211122402349813790.jpg", "appflag": 20, "appsern": 1, "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zcjd/bszcjd/202111/t20211110_1725982.htm", "fileext": "jpg", "_src": "/webpic/W0202111/W020211122/W020211122402349813790.jpg", "_href": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zcjd/bszcjd/202111/W020211122402349813790.jpg"}], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zcjd/bszcjd/202111/", "_firstpic": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zcjd/bszcjd/202111/W020211122402349813790.jpg", "rels": [{"reldocid": 1725961, "docid2": 1725982, "sern": 1, "srcdocpeople": "", "srcdocpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zcjd/bszcjd/202111/t20211110_1725982.htm", "srcdocreltime": "2021-11-10 17:34:00", "srcdoctitle": "图解：《三明市“十四五”现代综合交通运输体系专项规划》政策解读", "tardocpeople": "", "tardocpuburl": "https://www.sm.gov.cn/smsrmzfbgs/smsrmzf/zfxxgkml/ghjh/202111/t20211110_1725961.htm", "tardocreltime": "2021-11-10 17:18:00", "tardoctitle": "三明市人民政府办公室关于印发三明市“十四五”现代综合交通运输体系专项规划的通知"}]}, {"docid2": 1708063, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "规划解读", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zcjd/bszcjd/202109/t20210922_1708063.htm", "content": "\n　　近日，三明市人民政府办公室出台《三明市“十四五”开发区发展专项规划》。现对《规划》起草背景、基本特点、主要内容等相关情况进行解读。\n　　一、起草背景\n　　开发区是区域经济发展的重要增长极，是培育产业", "docabstract": "政策解读", "doclogo": "P020210930624888309204.png", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zcjd/bszcjd/202109/t20210922_1708063.htm", "docreltime": "2021.09.22 11:05:00", "doctitle": "图解：《三明市“十四五”开发区发展专项规划》政策解读", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 2, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1846908, "sourcename": "市政府办", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zcjd/bszcjd/202109/t20210922_1708063.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [{"appdesc": "2021093045.jpg", "appdocid": 1708063, "appfile": "W020210930624506169608.jpg", "appflag": 20, "appsern": 1, "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zcjd/bszcjd/202109/t20210922_1708063.htm", "fileext": "jpg", "_src": "/webpic/W0202109/W020210930/W020210930624506169608.jpg", "_href": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zcjd/bszcjd/202109/W020210930624506169608.jpg"}], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zcjd/bszcjd/202109/", "_firstpic": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zcjd/bszcjd/202109/W020210930624506169608.jpg", "rels": [{"reldocid": 1708033, "docid2": 1708063, "sern": 1, "srcdocpeople": "", "srcdocpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zcjd/bszcjd/202109/t20210922_1708063.htm", "srcdocreltime": "2021-09-22 11:05:00", "srcdoctitle": "图解：《三明市“十四五”开发区发展专项规划》政策解读", "tardocpeople": "", "tardocpuburl": "https://w